Mecha Knight is a Boss fought in 星之卡比 机器博博星球（Kirby: Planet Robobot）, appearing as the boss of Gigabyte Grounds. He is 魅塔骑士（Meta Knight）, but has been subdued, mechanized and taken over by the Haltmann Works Company to do their bidding. He wields a laser Galaxia, and possesses several robotic upgrades and implements, including jet wings, missile launchers and a laser eyepiece.
